<title>USA: Patriot American to buy Grand Heritage.</title>
<headline>Patriot American to buy Grand Heritage.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said Tuesday it has signed a binding agreement to buy Grant Heritage Hotels for $46.4 million.</p>
<p>The contract calls for the purchase of Grand Heritage's subsidiaries and two hotel properties in Chicago and Birmingham, Ala., it said.</p>
<p>In addition, Patriot will also make a $3.25 million investment in Grand Heritage's Broadview Hotel in Wichita, Kan., as part of the deal, it said.</p>
</text>
